/Title (For example, an analyst might review a recently reactivated account that starts receiving inbound payments from several unrelated sources. On its own, that may not be enough to trigger immediate concern. But when the analyst sees that the funds are being moved out quickly to newly added beneficiaries, that the same device has been used across other accounts, and that a linked identity attribute appears in prior cases, the picture changes.)
